  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Amaranthus hybridus",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amaranthus_hybridus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1369413875,
      "text": "Amaranthus hybridus, commonly called green amaranth, slim amaranth, smooth amaranth, smooth pigweed, or red amaranth, is a species of annual flowering plant. It is a weedy species found now over much of North America and introduced into Europe and Eurasia."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Amaranthus hybridus",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amaranthus_hybridus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 175706182,
      "text": "Amaranthus hybridus, conocido como bledo, quelite blanco, quintonil o quiltonil es una especie herbácea comestible perteneciente a la familia Amaranthaceae."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Amarante hybride",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amarante_hybride",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 240237344,
      "text": "L'amarante hybride est une espèce de plante herbacée assez grande de la famille des Amaranthacées ou des Chénopodiacées selon la classification classique de Cronquist (1981). Elle pousse souvent dans les terrains vagues. Elle porte jusqu'à 80 000 graines par pied."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Amaranthus hybridus",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amaranthus_hybridus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 64611911,
      "text": "Amaranthus hybridus é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família Amaranthaceae."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Bayam kakap",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bayam_kakap",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 29728944,
      "text": "Amaranthus hybridus, biasa disebut bayam hijau, bayam kakap, bayam halus, atau bayam merah, merupakan salah satu spesies tumbuhan berbunga tahunan. Ini adalah spesies bayam berdaun ramping yang sekarang ditemukan di sebagian besar Amerika Utara dan diperkenalkan ke Eropa dan Eurasia."
    }
  },
  "sections": {
    "uses": {
      "en": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (en): Amaranthus hybridus § Uses",
        "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amaranthus_hybridus#Uses",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 1369413875,
        "heading": "Uses",
        "text": "The seeds and cooked leaves are edible.\nThe plant was used for food and medicine by several Native American groups and in traditional African medicine.  It is among the species consumed as Quelite quintonil in Mexican food markets. It has weak antimicrobial activity, but contains promising anti-cancer phytochemicals.",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "fr": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Amarante hybride § Utilisations",
        "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amarante_hybride#Utilisations",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 240237344,
        "heading": "Utilisations",
        "text": "L’amarante hybride est cultivée comme légume en Afrique.\nDe nombreux groupes de populations autochtones d'Amérique du Sud ont développé une utilisation alimentaire et médicinale de la plante, sous le nom d'ataco. La graine est consommée sous forme de farine. Elle peut aussi être cuite entière mais devient alors très gélatineuse.\nC’est aussi une adventice capable, en raison de sa grande variabilité, de développer des résistances aux herbicides, aidée parfois par la culture d'OGM Roundup Ready de soja coexistant.",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "id": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (id): Bayam kakap § Kegunaan",
        "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bayam_kakap#Kegunaan",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 29728944,
        "heading": "Kegunaan",
        "text": "Biji dan daun yang dimasak bisa dimakan.\nTanaman ini digunakan untuk makanan dan obat-obatan oleh beberapa kelompok penduduk asli Amerika dan pengobatan tradisional Afrika. Ini adalah salah satu spesies yang dikonsumsi sebagai Quelite quintonilli di pasar makanan Meksiko.",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
  },
